  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dd80458d22eab8b4488d01a0ebbc6cc9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HistoryViewController
  pages:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 70b3f49851cf28743beb6db16ecc915b, type: 3}
    text: Beneath a shower of lights, Bravard and his friends entered the carnival,
      ready for an unforgettable night. Music filled the air, the games sparkled,
      and the crowd cheered... but the real show was only beginning. Behind the curtain,
      something mysterious had just awakened.
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d03bcbee42eb5341af671e818848e86, type: 3}
    text: Without warning, the lights flickered, the music stopped, and the attractions
      came to life. The chicks were trapped in games such as Dunk & Dash, can knockdown,
      fishing, and the balancing challenge. Laughter turned into cries for help...
      and the joyful show became a dangerous challenge.
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5efcbf80a0a8f294da2d872c0fc77f60, type: 3}
    text: 'When all seemed lost, Bravard stepped forward beneath the final spotlight.
      Beneath his enormous red helmet there was no fear, only a promise: none of
      his friends would be left behind. To rescue them, he must conquer every game
      and overcome every obstacle. The curtain has risen... and now the real performance
      begins.'
  storyImage: {fileID: 1523814208}
  imageCanvasGroup: {fileID: 1523814210}
  storyText: {fileID: 472988708}
